- 243 in base 6 is $ 2 \times 6^2 + 4 \times 6 + 3 = 2 \times 36 + 4 \times 6 + 3 = 72 + 24 + 3 = 99 $

Now, checking if 9 * 11 equals 99. 9*11 is 99, which is correct. So that works. 

