Now the denominator: 3^3 minus 3^2. Again, 3^3 is 27, as before. 3^2 is 9. So 27 minus 9 is 18. So the denominator is 18.

So the entire expression simplifies to 54 divided by 18. Let me do that division. 54 divided by 18 is 3. So the answer should be 3. 

